  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span>Hi all，</span><br /><span>【阿拉丁神灯】现申请相关资源及礼物配置，及上线申请。</span><br /><span>辛苦@叶导&nbsp;审批，&nbsp;</span><br /><span>辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</span></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>阿拉丁神灯</strong></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 1291.0px;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 67.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 60.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 88.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 61.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 187.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 72.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 324.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 431.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">礼物名称</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">礼物价值</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">礼物id</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">资源id</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">备注</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">描述</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">链接</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">阿拉丁神灯</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">21991</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">主播获得1映币，标签，幸</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">阿拉丁神灯，</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\">用户送给主播，主播获得1映币，剩余参与阿拉丁神灯魔法，最高可获得99999钻礼物。</td><td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202506/alading-light/index.html?from=plugin&amp;ik_halfdisplay=1&amp;half_screen=1\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202506/alading-light/index.html?from=plugin&amp;ik_halfdisplay=1&amp;half_screen=1</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong>上线时间：</strong></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">2026年2月23日00:00:00-2月25日23:59:59</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong>位置：</strong></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">推荐墙首页，</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong>上新气泡：</strong></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,51,102);\"><span class=\"currentHitHighlight\">气泡</span>：活动礼物</span><span><br /></span><span>气泡</span><span>类型：默认</span><span><br /></span><span>定位礼物：阿拉灯神灯</span><span>（id：21991</span><span>）</span><span><br /></span><span>生效场景：所有</span><span><br /></span><span>生效人群：all</span><span><br /></span><span>生效批次：首次</span><span><br /></span><span>生效时间：2026年2月23日00:00:00-2月25日23:59:59</span><span><br /></span><span>优先级：1</span></p><p><span><strong>全站私信</strong></span><br /><span>2月23日00:10:00</span><br /><span>文案：【阿拉灯神灯】上线啦~最高可拆出99999热力值礼物，快来参与吧~</span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">以上，如有问题，及时沟通～​</span></span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
